1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:17,846
Writing, task one. Form number 1. You want to join a fitness centre. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:18,533 --> 00:00:20,694
What sport do you do and how often?

3
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:34,860
I go running in the park three times a week and in winter I sometimes swim in the pool.

4
00:00:35,767 --> 00:00:38,001
Why do you want to come to our fitness centre?

5
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:53,011
I want to come to your centre because it is close to my home and you have modern machines.

6
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:55,437
When do you have time to exercise?

7
00:01:05,833 --> 00:01:10,235
I have time to exercise mainly in the evening after work, from six o'clock, and at the weekend.

8
00:01:11,133 --> 00:01:23,283
Writing, task one. Form number 2. You want to register at the city library. Answer the registration questions. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

9
00:01:23,966 --> 00:01:26,179
What books or magazines do you like to read?

10
00:01:36,566 --> 00:01:41,357
I like reading detective stories and historical novels, sometimes also a cooking magazine.

11
00:01:42,266 --> 00:01:44,559
Why do you want to register at our library?

12
00:01:54,966 --> 00:01:59,275
I want to register because books are expensive and I want to read more in Czech.

13
00:02:00,166 --> 00:02:01,966
When do you have time to go to the library?

14
00:02:12,366 --> 00:02:16,473
I can go to the library on Tuesday and Thursday afternoons or on Saturday morning.

15
00:02:17,367 --> 00:02:28,520
Writing, task one. Form number 3. The town is running a survey for residents. Answer the questions. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

16
00:02:29,234 --> 00:02:31,034
How long have you lived in our town?

17
00:02:41,434 --> 00:02:46,307
I have lived in Kralupy for five years, I moved here with my family in 2021.

18
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,803
What do you like about the town?

19
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:03,474
I like the river, the nice park and that the town is quiet and clean.

20
00:03:04,367 --> 00:03:06,185
What would you like to change in the town?

21
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:20,860
I would like more playgrounds for children and a better bus connection to Prague.

22
00:03:21,767 --> 00:03:35,329
Writing, task one. Form number 4. You want a part-time job in a supermarket. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

23
00:03:36,034 --> 00:03:37,614
What work have you done before?

24
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:52,540
For two years I worked as a shop assistant in a grocery store and stocked the shelves.

25
00:03:53,434 --> 00:03:55,801
Why do you want to work in our supermarket?

26
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:12,032
I want to work for you because the supermarket is close and I'm looking for a part-time job.

27
00:04:12,934 --> 00:04:14,297
When can you work?

28
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:28,973
I can work Monday to Friday in the afternoon and every other Saturday all day.

29
00:04:29,867 --> 00:04:42,004
Writing, task one. Form number 5. You want to enrol your child in an after-school club. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

30
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:44,967
What does your child like doing in their free time?

31
00:04:55,367 --> 00:04:59,886
My daughter likes drawing, singing and playing with friends outside at the playground.

32
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,939
Why do you want to enrol your child in our club?

33
00:05:13,334 --> 00:05:17,837
I want to enrol her because she will learn new things there and make friends.

34
00:05:18,734 --> 00:05:20,807
When can your child attend the club?

35
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:35,052
She can go on Mondays and Wednesdays after school, from three o'clock.

36
00:05:38,467 --> 00:05:43,146
Writing, task two. E-mail number 1: Looking for a flat.

37
00:05:43,834 --> 00:05:53,952
You want to move. Write an e-mail to an estate agency. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

38
00:06:02,667 --> 00:06:03,734
Hello,

39
00:06:04,034 --> 00:06:05,681
I am looking for a flat to rent.

40
00:06:05,967 --> 00:06:09,072
I need a 2+1 flat because I have a wife and a son.

41
00:06:09,367 --> 00:06:11,926
We want to live near the centre or near a school.

42
00:06:12,234 --> 00:06:15,537
We can pay at most 18,000 CZK a month.

43
00:06:15,834 --> 00:06:18,094
We want to move from 1 September.

44
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:21,601
I can come to see the flat on Monday or Wednesday afternoon.

45
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:23,231
Thank you for your reply.

46
00:06:23,534 --> 00:06:30,975
This e-mail has 52 words. One sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

47
00:06:31,667 --> 00:06:36,007
Writing, task two. E-mail number 2: Illness.

48
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:46,815
You are ill and cannot come to work. Write an e-mail to your manager. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

49
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:57,122
Dear Mr Dvořák,

50
00:06:57,434 --> 00:07:00,101
I am sorry, but I can't come to work today.

51
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:02,665
I have a high temperature and a sore throat.

52
00:07:02,967 --> 00:07:05,589
The doctor told me I must stay at home for a week.

53
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:09,937
I will probably be back on Monday 10 February. My colleague Petr can do my work.

54
00:07:10,234 --> 00:07:14,804
You can call me on 605 123 456.

55
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:21,859
This e-mail has 53 words. One sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

56
00:07:22,567 --> 00:07:27,601
Writing, task two. E-mail number 3: A weekend trip.

57
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:37,861
You want to invite a friend on a trip. Write him an e-mail. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

58
00:07:46,567 --> 00:07:47,812
Hi Martin,

59
00:07:48,100 --> 00:07:49,694
do you want to come on a trip with us?

60
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,770
We're going to Karlštejn Castle.

61
00:07:52,067 --> 00:07:54,210
We'll leave on Saturday morning at eight.

62
00:07:54,500 --> 00:07:57,480
We'll take the train from Prague, it's only 40 minutes.

63
00:07:57,767 --> 00:08:01,270
We'll have a tour of the castle and then go for a walk in the forest.

64
00:08:01,567 --> 00:08:04,387
Bring comfortable shoes and something to eat.

65
00:08:04,700 --> 00:08:06,516
Let me know if you're coming.

66
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:13,831
This e-mail has 56 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

67
00:08:14,533 --> 00:08:20,063
Writing, task two. E-mail number 4: Booking a room.

68
00:08:20,766 --> 00:08:31,583
You want to go on holiday to Šumava with your family. Write an e-mail to the hotel. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

69
00:08:40,266 --> 00:08:41,333
Good afternoon,

70
00:08:41,633 --> 00:08:43,906
I would like to book a room in your hotel.

71
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:48,639
We will arrive on Friday 10 July and leave on Sunday 19 July.

72
00:08:48,933 --> 00:08:51,797
There will be three of us: me, my wife and my son.

73
00:08:52,100 --> 00:08:54,249
We would like a family room with a balcony.

74
00:08:54,533 --> 00:08:56,802
We would like breakfast and dinner at the hotel.

75
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:59,900
We're coming by car, we need a parking space.

76
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:02,734
Thank you, I look forward to your reply.

77
00:09:03,033 --> 00:09:10,474
This e-mail has 52 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

78
00:09:11,167 --> 00:09:16,025
Writing, task two. E-mail number 5: Complaint about shoes.

79
00:09:16,734 --> 00:09:27,690
You bought shoes online but there is a problem with them. Write an e-mail to the shop. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

80
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,467
Good afternoon,

81
00:09:37,767 --> 00:09:44,525
I bought Nike sports shoes from you, size 43. I bought them online on 2 October.

82
00:09:44,834 --> 00:09:48,958
I've only worn them for a week and they're already broken, the left shoe has a hole.

83
00:09:49,267 --> 00:09:51,256
I would like to exchange them for new ones.

84
00:09:51,567 --> 00:09:53,486
I'll send the shoes back to you by post tomorrow.

85
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:55,131
Thank you for your reply.

86
00:09:55,434 --> 00:10:02,387
This e-mail has 50 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.
